{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38387","headline":"寄殿院高侍御 · 吴融","name":"寄殿院高侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄梅雨细羃长洲，柳密花疎水慢流。\n钓艇正寻逋客去，绣衣方结少年游。\n风前不肯看垂手，灯下还应惜裹头。\n一夜自怜无羽翼，独当何逊滴阶愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}